title: Going to a file four folders deep opens its folders in the explorer and marks its row (look at the pictures)
folders: edit-deep
limit: 40

wait 3000
left files
wait 500
mark before
wait 400
goto one/two/three/four/leaf.rs
wait 1800
mark leaf
wait 400
goto zeta/last.rs
wait 1800
mark last
wait 400
left none
wait 400
goto one/other/near.rs
wait 1500
left files
wait 600
mark near-after-reopening
wait 400
edit one/two/side.rs 1 1
wait 800
mark caret-in-side
wait 400
quit
